<title>JAPAN: Super Tool - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Super Tool - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 15, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  2.47		vs	    2.15</p>
<p> Operating	  205    million    vs	  151    million</p>
<p> Current	    164    million    vs	  108    million</p>
<p> Net		   65    million    vs	   43    million</p>
<p> EPS		    7.41 yen	  vs	    4.99 yen</p>
<p> Shares		9 million	  vs	   9 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Super Tool Co Ltd makes industrial-use tools and labour-saving equipment for transport.</p>
</text>
